      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -624,
        -496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 552,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## Approve employee expenses with AI, Google Sheets and Telegram\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives employee expense submissions through a webhook, validates the input, uses an AI agent to evaluate and categorize the expense (vendor, category, amount, policy note), logs it to Google Sheets, and routes approval: expenses flagged by the AI (<50, unclear, personal, or unusual) alert the manager on Telegram and email with a policy note, while auto-approved expenses confirm directly to the employee. A monthly report summarizes expenses by department and sends it to the manager.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the webhook URL in your expense form or app.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and set the target spreadsheet and sheet.\n- Connect OpenAI credentials for the expense evaluation agent.\n- Connect Telegram bot credentials and set the manager chat ID.\n- Set the Gmail recipient for email alerts.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the approval threshold, categories, notification channels, or the monthly report schedule to fit your business. Add per-employee budget limits by reading a budget sheet and comparing totals before routing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
